+   *  through those bodies is never loaded, optimized or code-generated.
+   *  Patterns arrive `;`-joined in the `scalino.prune` link-time property
+   *  (a String, so it is part of the config hash and a changed list forces
+   *  a full relink). A pattern is `pkg.Class` (also matches `pkg.Class$`,
+   *  `pkg.Class$Inner`, ...), a package `pkg.sub` (everything below it), or
+   *  `pkg.Class#method` to prune a single method name.
